{"id":"principio","lemma":"principio","pos":"noun","rank":638,"glosses":["principle","cause, origin","beginning, start, outset, get-go"],"ipa":"/pɾinˈθipjo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"principios"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-principio.wav","examples":[{"text":"Comienza del principio.","en":"Start at the beginning.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461919","words":[{"g":"to begin, to commence","l":"comenzar"},{"g":"of the"},null]},{"text":"Va contra mis principios.","en":"It's against my principles.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/540729","words":[{"g":"okay"},{"g":"antidote"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Al principio no le creí.","en":"I didn't believe him at first.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/355168","words":[{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"}]},{"text":"Debes vivir según tus principios.","en":"You must live up to your principles.","words":[{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to live"},{"g":"according to"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"¿No podemos empezar desde el principio?","en":"Can't we start over?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449766","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to prune","l":"podar"},{"g":"to start"},{"g":"since"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}